<%!-- Hero Section --%>
<section class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-pink-50 to-purple-50 pt-20">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-16 lg:py-24">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center">
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6 text-gray-900">
        Relationship & Harassment Policy
      </h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-gray-700 mb-8">
        Creating a safe, respectful environment free from harassment and unwanted advances
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <%!-- Decorative rainbow gradient --%>
  <div class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 right-0 h-1 bg-gradient-to-r from-red-400 via-yellow-400 via-green-400 via-blue-400 via-indigo-400 to-purple-400">
  </div>
</section>

<div class="min-h-screen bg-white">
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-12">
    <%!-- Core Statement --%>
    <div class="bg-red-50 border-2 border-red-300 rounded-lg p-8 mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-start">
        <svg
          class="w-8 h-8 text-red-600 mr-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-1"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        >
          <path
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            stroke-width="2"
            d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"
          >
          </path>
        </svg>
        <div>
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-red-900 mb-3">Our Commitment to Safety</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-800 leading-relaxed">
            Ironfolk Combat takes the physical and emotional safety of its members very seriously. Training and events are designed as safe spaces for camaraderie, friendship, fun, and community. <strong>This club is not a dating service</strong>, and many join wanting only to learn swords or make platonic friends. Using or viewing Ironfolk as a dating service goes against our opt-in and consent-based values, creates an unsafe environment, and will not be tolerated.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%!-- Guidelines Section --%>
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center">
        <span class="w-2 h-8 bg-pink-500 mr-3 rounded"></span> Mandatory Guidelines
      </h2>

      <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">
        To ensure everyone's safety, all members must agree to and follow these guidelines at trainings and events:
      </p>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-50 to-purple-50 border-l-4 border-pink-500 rounded-r-lg p-6">
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <svg
              class="w-6 h-6 text-pink-600 mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"
              >
              </path>
            </svg>
            <p class="text-gray-700">
              <strong>Friendliness is NOT interest.</strong>
              Politeness, friendliness, or club membership should never be assumed as interest in dating.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-50 to-pink-50 border-l-4 border-purple-500 rounded-r-lg p-6">
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <svg
              class="w-6 h-6 text-purple-600 mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M18.364 18.364A9 9 0 005.636 5.636m12.728 12.728A9 9 0 015.636 5.636m12.728 12.728L5.636 5.636"
              >
              </path>
            </svg>
            <p class="text-gray-700">
              <strong>Zero tolerance for harassment.</strong>
              Sexual harassment, including any implicit or explicit suggestive actions or comments made without explicit consent, will absolutely not be tolerated.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-50 to-purple-50 border-l-4 border-pink-500 rounded-r-lg p-6">
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <svg
              class="w-6 h-6 text-pink-600 mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M18.364 18.364A9 9 0 005.636 5.636m12.728 12.728A9 9 0 015.636 5.636m12.728 12.728L5.636 5.636"
              >
              </path>
            </svg>
            <p class="text-gray-700">
              <strong>No hitting on members.</strong>
              Hitting on members implicitly or explicitly is not acceptable, regardless of how this is received.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-50 to-pink-50 border-l-4 border-purple-500 rounded-r-lg p-6">
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <svg
              class="w-6 h-6 text-purple-600 mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M18.364 18.364A9 9 0 005.636 5.636m12.728 12.728A9 9 0 015.636 5.636m12.728 12.728L5.636 5.636"
              >
              </path>
            </svg>
            <p class="text-gray-700">
              <strong>No sexual jokes or comments.</strong>
              Sexual jokes or comments about members are not acceptable, regardless of how this is received.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-50 to-purple-50 border-l-4 border-pink-500 rounded-r-lg p-6">
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <svg
              class="w-6 h-6 text-pink-600 mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"
              >
              </path>
            </svg>
            <p class="text-gray-700">
              <strong>Always ask for consent.</strong>
              Explicit consent must be obtained before touching anyone, even in a platonic-intended way.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-50 to-pink-50 border-l-4 border-purple-500 rounded-r-lg p-6">
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <svg
              class="w-6 h-6 text-purple-600 mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"
              >
              </path>
            </svg>
            <p class="text-gray-700">
              <strong>Power dynamics matter.</strong>
              Senior members, including Leadership and long-standing members, must be especially aware of power dynamics and not hit on newbies, regardless of how it is received.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-50 to-purple-50 border-l-4 border-pink-500 rounded-r-lg p-6">
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <svg
              class="w-6 h-6 text-pink-600 mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M14.828 14.828a4 4 0 01-5.656 0M9 10h.01M15 10h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"
              >
              </path>
            </svg>
            <p class="text-gray-700">
              <strong>Respectful PDA.</strong>
              Public displays of affection within existing relationships should be reasonable and respectful of others' space.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-purple-50 to-pink-50 border-l-4 border-purple-500 rounded-r-lg p-6">
          <div class="flex items-start">
            <svg
              class="w-6 h-6 text-purple-600 mr-3 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5"
              fill="none"
              stroke="currentColor"
              viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
              <path
                stroke-linecap="round"
                stroke-linejoin="round"
                stroke-width="2"
                d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"
              >
              </path>
            </svg>
            <p class="text-gray-700">
              <strong>Applies outside club too.</strong>
              Even outside Ironfolk trainings and events, a member's participation in informal hangouts should never be assumed as interest in dating. Explicit consent is always required.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%!-- Unacceptable Behavior --%>
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center">
        <span class="w-2 h-8 bg-red-500 mr-3 rounded"></span> Examples of Unacceptable Behavior
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-red-50 border-2 border-red-200 rounded-lg p-8">
        <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">Examples include, but are not limited to:</p>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="bg-white border border-red-200 rounded-lg p-4">
            <p class="text-gray-800">
              <strong>Misinterpreting kindness as interest</strong>
              - It's common for someone feeling uncomfortable to respond politely out of fear of upsetting the other person. Politeness is NOT consent or interest.
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-red-200 rounded-lg p-4">
            <p class="text-gray-800">
              <strong>Asking about sexual preferences</strong>
              - This includes asking for someone's Fetlife account or if they're "in the kink scene."
            </p>
          </div>

          <div class="bg-white border border-red-200 rounded-lg p-4">
            <p class="text-gray-800">
              <strong>Joining with dating intentions</strong>
              - Participating in the club with the primary intention of finding people to date.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%!-- Recourse Section --%>
    <div class="mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-6 flex items-center">
        <span class="w-2 h-8 bg-pink-500 mr-3 rounded"></span> Reporting and Recourse
      </h2>

      <div class="bg-blue-50 border-2 border-blue-300 rounded-lg p-8 mb-6">
        <div class="flex items-start mb-4">
          <svg
            class="w-8 h-8 text-blue-600 mr-4 flex-shrink-0"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
          >
            <path
              stroke-linecap="round"
              stroke-linejoin="round"
              stroke-width="2"
              d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"
            >
            </path>
          </svg>
          <div>
            <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Anonymous Reporting</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">
              An anonymous reporting form for sexual harassment and any breaches of the Code of Conduct is available:
            </p>
            <a
              href="https://forms.gle/6vKumeJv3EdC2yih6"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-pink-600 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-pink-700 transition-colors"
            >
              Submit Anonymous Report
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 ml-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M10 6H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2h10a2 2 0 002-2v-4M14 4h6m0 0v6m0-6L10 14"
                >
                </path>
              </svg>
            </a>
            <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-3">
              <strong>Your safety is our priority.</strong>
              Ironfolk will ensure the safety, anonymity, and support of those reporting. Any retaliation may lead to immediate dismissal from the club.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
        <%!-- Consequences --%>
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-yellow-50 to-orange-50 border-2 border-yellow-300 rounded-lg p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">How Offenses Are Handled</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-700">
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <span class="text-yellow-600 font-bold mr-2">•</span>
              <span>Offenses dealt with case-by-case based on Code of Conduct procedures</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <span class="text-yellow-600 font-bold mr-2">•</span>
              <span>
                <strong>First offense:</strong>
                Unintentional comments may constitute Minor Misconduct
              </span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <span class="text-orange-600 font-bold mr-2">•</span>
              <span>
                <strong>Repeated/intentional:</strong>
                May constitute Major Misconduct and lead to dismissal
              </span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <span class="text-red-600 font-bold mr-2">•</span>
              <span>
                <strong>Safety endangerment:</strong>
                Immediate dismissal and involvement of appropriate authorities
              </span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <%!-- Your Rights --%>
        <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-green-50 to-teal-50 border-2 border-green-300 rounded-lg p-6">
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Your Rights</h3>
          <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm text-gray-700">
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-green-600 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"
                >
                </path>
              </svg>
              <span>Report anonymously without fear</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-green-600 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"
                >
                </path>
              </svg>
              <span>Receive support and protection</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-green-600 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"
                >
                </path>
              </svg>
              <span>Be protected from retaliation</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start">
              <svg
                class="w-5 h-5 text-green-600 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
              >
                <path
                  stroke-linecap="round"
                  stroke-linejoin="round"
                  stroke-width="2"
                  d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"
                >
                </path>
              </svg>
              <span>Have your concerns taken seriously</span>
            </li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%!-- Acknowledgment Note --%>
    <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-pink-50 to-purple-50 border-2 border-pink-300 rounded-lg p-8">
      <div class="flex items-start">
        <svg
          class="w-8 h-8 text-pink-600 mr-4 flex-shrink-0 mt-1"
          fill="none"
          stroke="currentColor"
          viewBox="0 0 24 24"
        >
          <path
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            stroke-width="2"
            d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z"
          >
          </path>
        </svg>
        <div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Policy Acknowledgment Required</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700">
            Upon approval of your membership, you will be required to sign a physical or digital acknowledgment of this policy before your first training session. This ensures all members understand and agree to maintain a harassment-free environment.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
